config BR2_PACKAGE_FATHOM_SYSTEM
	bool "fathom-system"
	help
	  Fathom's small system helpers, built from the repository's
	  device/ folder: fathom-usbrole (the USB-C port's role, in the
	  root filesystem) and fathom-nocache.so (keeps the network
	  drive's and SFTP's reads out of the page cache; on the card).
